      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "Subtract 2x: 5 = x - 7. Add 7: 12 = x.",
      "steps": [
        "1. Subtract 2x: 5 = x - 7.",
        "2. Add 7: 12 = x.",
        "3. So x = 12."
